WEBVTT

00:02.900 --> 00:04.300
Monado,

00:04.300 --> 00:09.340
I apologize for breaking my vow to you.

00:09.340 --> 00:13.170
But to allow a source of evil to persist...

00:13.170 --> 00:18.170
They are nothing to us, the Logos.

00:18.710 --> 00:19.710
But-

00:19.710 --> 00:23.150
I order you to withdraw for the moment.

00:23.850 --> 00:26.620
You may not leave here.

00:26.620 --> 00:28.150
Wh-What?

00:28.690 --> 00:31.130
It'll be the same with Eins and Zwei.

00:31.830 --> 00:33.360
Inform them.

00:33.360 --> 00:36.060
What about the retrieval of the Artifacts?

00:36.060 --> 00:37.860
I can do that at any time.

00:38.400 --> 00:39.370
Leave.

00:41.900 --> 00:42.870
Very well.

00:51.050 --> 00:56.040
Vier, why did the Logos provide him?

00:56.920 --> 01:00.080
Eins and Zwei are strong warriors,

01:01.120 --> 01:03.920
and I chose you to come along.

01:04.890 --> 01:05.860
Yes.

01:06.490 --> 01:10.560
However, it's not as though he has demonstrated merit in the past.

01:11.430 --> 01:13.930
He just suddenly became my servant.

01:16.240 --> 01:18.040
I'll look into it.

01:21.080 --> 01:23.670
<i>I can't understand.</i>

01:25.250 --> 01:25.980
<i>Why?</i>

01:27.120 --> 01:29.210
<i>Why are you doing this?</i>

03:09.320 --> 03:11.290
I've been put away.

03:14.420 --> 03:17.190
How can I apologize?

03:18.830 --> 03:21.320
Who are you?

03:23.500 --> 03:24.660
A dream?

03:25.700 --> 03:29.200
The

03:25.700 --> 03:29.200
Breaking

03:25.700 --> 03:29.200
of Bonds

03:27.000 --> 03:29.830
Was I crying?

03:31.740 --> 03:33.370
What could it be?

03:33.370 --> 03:36.280
I've had this dream before.

03:41.250 --> 03:42.840
It's all right.

03:43.350 --> 03:45.340
I just woke up.

03:53.630 --> 03:55.060
Mitsuru?

03:55.960 --> 03:59.400
I see. Mitsuru can't sleep either.

04:02.540 --> 04:07.070
I hope Takuma and the others can come to school tomorrow.

04:08.680 --> 04:14.550
Mendel used green peas to determine the law of heredity.

04:14.550 --> 04:19.720
In other words, he put forward the concept of genes.

04:20.220 --> 04:22.750
Listen up. This will be on the test.

04:45.410 --> 04:46.710
Stand.

04:48.150 --> 04:49.280
Bow.

04:55.690 --> 04:56.490
Huh?

04:57.290 --> 05:00.460
Where have I seen him?

05:06.000 --> 05:07.540
Hey, you!

05:07.540 --> 05:08.800
Sexual harasser!

05:11.470 --> 05:13.070
You again?

05:13.070 --> 05:15.410
Do you want me to do it again?

05:16.480 --> 05:19.650
I-If you do something like that again, I'll turn you in.

05:19.650 --> 05:23.050
Again? So then you're fine with what happened before?

05:24.950 --> 05:26.990
Of course not!

05:26.990 --> 05:30.120
I'm going to complain about what you did before as well!

05:30.790 --> 05:32.350
Do whatever you want.

05:32.690 --> 05:35.160
What class are you from?

05:36.700 --> 05:38.220
Why do you care?

05:38.570 --> 05:41.760
So I can tell the teacher.

05:43.240 --> 05:44.470
Fine.

05:44.870 --> 05:46.470
Don't bother me.

05:47.810 --> 05:49.780
You don't have to tell me.

05:49.780 --> 05:51.800
I have no desire to bother you.

05:52.480 --> 05:55.480
speak to me so informally.

05:52.480 --> 05:58.020
I don't remember letting you

05:55.480 --> 05:58.020
speak to me so ru-

05:58.020 --> 05:59.820
Hey, Tamaki!

06:00.860 --> 06:03.990
Did you hear? Ms. Fiona's
English class...

06:03.990 --> 06:06.190
is study hall today and tomorrow.

06:06.690 --> 06:08.900
Gah! Ryou Kutani!

06:08.900 --> 06:12.870
"Gah"? Kiyono, you know this sexual harasser?

06:12.870 --> 06:16.470
I-I don't know if I'd say "know," but...

06:16.470 --> 06:17.340
Hey.

06:17.740 --> 06:19.870
Don't go running your mouth.

06:20.040 --> 06:21.340
O-Okay!

06:24.980 --> 06:27.470
I-I thought I was going to die.

06:28.420 --> 06:32.350
He looks like he could murder someone with just a look.

06:32.750 --> 06:34.690
He could kill someone.

06:34.690 --> 06:37.390
Yeah. I can tell.

06:38.930 --> 06:41.660
But I didn't know you knew him.

06:41.660 --> 06:46.030
That's not- Wait, aren't you in the same class?

06:46.030 --> 06:47.440
Really?

06:47.440 --> 06:50.670
Apparently he was suspended,

06:50.670 --> 06:53.230
and since he had to repeat a grade, he's been coming less and less.

06:53.810 --> 06:56.400
Everyone was talking about it.

06:58.150 --> 06:59.550
Really?

06:59.550 --> 07:03.080
Do you think I want to know someone like him?

07:04.650 --> 07:09.160
Right? I don't know much more than that.

07:09.160 --> 07:11.330
And I told you about the study hall classes,

07:11.330 --> 07:12.630
so I'll see you later.

07:12.630 --> 07:13.620
Okay.

07:37.990 --> 07:40.280
Hello, Tamaki.

07:45.590 --> 07:46.890
Everyone...

07:48.130 --> 07:49.560
How?

07:51.930 --> 07:55.390
We heal far faster than the average person.

07:58.540 --> 08:00.740
Then come to class!

08:01.940 --> 08:03.100
We're sorry.

08:05.210 --> 08:09.080
But I'm glad you're all okay.

08:15.890 --> 08:17.090
You're glad?

08:18.160 --> 08:23.830
We were completely destroyed, embarrassed,

08:23.830 --> 08:28.100
gave up the Artifact and then allowed to live...

08:28.100 --> 08:29.660
And you're glad?

08:30.400 --> 08:32.640
They had overwhelming power.

08:34.010 --> 08:37.180
We didn't stand a chance.

08:37.180 --> 08:37.650
That's-

08:37.650 --> 08:41.280
I had always believed we were the protectors of the seal.

08:42.350 --> 08:46.490
But then, coming here, fighting against them...

08:46.490 --> 08:47.510
Damn it!

08:51.730 --> 08:53.520
Y-Yeah...

08:54.530 --> 08:57.060
But there's always next time...

08:57.060 --> 08:59.100
What do you know?

08:59.100 --> 09:03.200
We're the ones who understand the difference in strength.

09:04.240 --> 09:05.270
Takuma!

09:05.270 --> 09:09.640
But you're all here right now.

09:10.340 --> 09:11.900
What about it?

09:13.250 --> 09:18.310
What do you know about our responsibility to fight?

09:20.690 --> 09:22.420
If that kid hadn't stopped us then,

09:22.420 --> 09:26.720
we would've been dead in an instant.

09:27.500 --> 09:29.930
The difference in strength is obvious!

09:29.930 --> 09:33.100
But you protected me!

09:33.100 --> 09:35.700
You protected me until the end!

09:36.570 --> 09:38.510
You weren't protected!

09:39.340 --> 09:40.900
You were just overlooked!

09:41.380 --> 09:42.870
Why don't you get it?!

09:43.740 --> 09:45.980
Takuma, Mahiro, enough.

09:56.790 --> 09:59.420
I'm sorry...

10:01.600 --> 10:06.130
It's true I couldn't do anything.

10:06.130 --> 10:08.190
I couldn't do anything...

10:08.700 --> 10:13.230
But I want to be of use to you.

10:14.780 --> 10:16.540
I want to help you fight!

10:16.740 --> 10:17.880
You're...

10:17.880 --> 10:21.040
still holding onto that dream?

10:22.820 --> 10:25.580
No one expects you to fight.

10:26.250 --> 10:29.380
Don't worry, I'll protect the seal.

10:30.320 --> 10:32.920
Though, I'm not confident that I can.

10:33.630 --> 10:34.730
No-

10:34.000 --> 10:36.990
Tamaki, we're tools.

10:37.330 --> 10:39.390
Tools for the Tamayori princess.

10:40.330 --> 10:42.640
When told to fight, we fight.

10:42.640 --> 10:44.300
And we'll protect both you and the seal.

10:44.710 --> 10:46.640
Even if it costs us our lives.

10:47.480 --> 10:49.270
So stop already.

10:50.880 --> 10:53.980
Don't try to understand us.

10:53.980 --> 10:55.950
Don't come into our hearts.

11:09.200 --> 11:10.790
Study Hall

11:18.040 --> 11:20.670
<i>"Don't come into our hearts"?</i>

11:21.680 --> 11:22.700
<i>Why?</i>

11:35.590 --> 11:38.060
It's my turn to take you home.

11:38.730 --> 11:40.390
Where are Takuma and the others?

11:40.390 --> 11:42.160
Patrolling the seal.

11:43.060 --> 11:44.230
They left already.

11:49.740 --> 11:51.210
It's our duty.

11:51.870 --> 11:53.310
We cannot avoid it.

11:54.980 --> 11:56.030
I...

11:56.680 --> 11:57.800
It's all right.

11:58.510 --> 11:59.540
I understand.

12:03.520 --> 12:05.540
You got an earful at lunch today.

12:08.190 --> 12:12.290
But I feel like I had to hear it.

12:13.090 --> 12:18.470
Mahiro and Takuma don't like to show their weakness to others.

12:20.530 --> 12:26.630
Being a Shugogo member also means you're not human.

12:27.580 --> 12:28.570
Tamaki...

12:29.980 --> 12:31.380
We aren't like you.

12:36.950 --> 12:40.180
From a human perspective, we're wild animals.

12:41.020 --> 12:44.990
If the seal disappears, we will be outcast,

12:44.990 --> 12:47.090
people will reject us, and we'll be persecuted.

12:48.900 --> 12:50.590
That's all we are.

12:53.370 --> 12:57.700
W-Why do you say things like that?

12:59.540 --> 13:01.240
That isn't fair.

13:02.710 --> 13:06.550
You and Mahiro and everyone...

13:07.920 --> 13:12.150
You say you're not human and distance yourself from people,

13:12.150 --> 13:14.090
but you protect me.

13:17.260 --> 13:22.130
You all say terrible things, and you're selfish and mean,

13:22.130 --> 13:25.900
but you're all important friends to me.

13:26.830 --> 13:29.770
Nothing else.

13:30.170 --> 13:33.570
Saying you're not human, that's...

13:39.150 --> 13:41.210
Thank you, Tamaki.

13:58.730 --> 14:03.600
I have to figure out what I am by myself.

14:04.140 --> 14:06.160
I am the Tamayori princess, after all.

14:08.310 --> 14:11.400
I'm going to do it, O-chan.

14:12.510 --> 14:16.450
Because there's so much around me that I don't know.

14:22.560 --> 14:24.320
Listen up, everyone!

14:24.730 --> 14:27.790
We'll be moving around again.

14:28.330 --> 14:30.630
So I'll be counting on your cooperation.

14:31.700 --> 14:36.240
First, Takuma and Mahiro, stop patrolling the seal.

14:36.240 --> 14:37.370
What?

14:37.370 --> 14:38.510
What are you...

14:38.510 --> 14:41.100
I want to find out who we are.

14:41.440 --> 14:43.710
That's why I'd like to go back to the shed,

14:43.710 --> 14:46.840
and find out about the Tamayori princess and ourselves.

14:47.920 --> 14:50.020
Thoroughly, this time.

14:50.020 --> 14:52.390
I'd like you two to come with me.

14:52.390 --> 14:54.360
Do it by yourself.

14:54.720 --> 14:58.660
Why are you trying to find out?

14:59.190 --> 15:01.720
Because if we leave things as they are, we'll lose.

15:03.760 --> 15:06.060
That might be going a bit too far...

15:06.700 --> 15:08.100
No.

15:08.100 --> 15:10.590
I accept the truth as truth.

15:11.370 --> 15:14.240
And from an optimistic view,

15:14.240 --> 15:17.680
I think that gathering information is most important right now.

15:18.750 --> 15:20.310
About our enemies as well.

15:22.080 --> 15:25.310
You don't know everything clearly either, right?

15:26.050 --> 15:28.750
About the Shugogo house or about the seal.

15:29.360 --> 15:31.550
Well, that's true, I suppose.

15:32.560 --> 15:34.430
Then, help me.

15:34.430 --> 15:36.760
Why us, though?

15:37.200 --> 15:40.260
It's obvious that Ohmi would be far better at it.

15:41.600 --> 15:45.130
Because if I leave you two, you'll do something rash.

15:45.510 --> 15:47.600
That's fine.

15:48.080 --> 15:51.650
As long as we protect the seal, that's enough.

15:51.650 --> 15:53.950
There's no way you can, though!

15:53.950 --> 15:55.550
That's why...

15:55.550 --> 15:59.280
Because you see your lives as expendable...

16:03.390 --> 16:04.830
I understand.

16:04.830 --> 16:07.160
I'll keep an eye on the seal,

16:07.160 --> 16:09.630
and try to find out where the Logos are hiding.

16:09.630 --> 16:11.830
Shinji, you will?

16:11.830 --> 16:13.270
But you're...

16:13.270 --> 16:17.870
Because I'm the weakest, I won't be rash.

16:17.870 --> 16:20.200
I'm sensitive to danger as well.

16:21.610 --> 16:26.950
The fact that they've shown up so frequently means they must be close by.

16:27.580 --> 16:30.980
I am concerned that there hasn't been any movement in the past few days.

16:31.520 --> 16:34.890
Then I'll try the library.

16:34.890 --> 16:36.690
The library?

16:36.690 --> 16:40.390
These grounds didn't always belong to the school.

16:41.500 --> 16:43.960
Then what was it before?

16:44.470 --> 16:45.430
I don't know.

16:47.470 --> 16:51.110
I believe it belonged to the government,

16:51.110 --> 16:54.840
and was hidden from the general public.

16:54.840 --> 16:56.880
In any case, something like that.

16:56.740 --> 16:58.880
Library

16:57.710 --> 17:01.850
The library archives contain information on every organization.

17:03.880 --> 17:06.250
Then it's decided.

17:06.250 --> 17:07.950
I'm counting on you.

17:10.760 --> 17:14.730
If Shinji and Yuichi both are on board, then I don't have a choice.

17:14.730 --> 17:16.090
We'll go with you.

17:17.000 --> 17:17.990
All right!

17:19.670 --> 17:21.600
Oh, class is starting!

17:21.600 --> 17:24.240
It's fine. It's just study hall.

17:24.240 --> 17:26.940
No, it's not. There was a handout.

17:39.850 --> 17:40.790
Monado.

17:41.320 --> 17:45.260
I have the results from headquarters of the investigation on Drei.

17:48.930 --> 17:53.630
Apparently there was another candidate for the position of the third servant.

17:54.200 --> 17:58.700
Then what happened to the one who was meant to serve me?

17:59.240 --> 18:01.610
Failed during another mission.

18:02.080 --> 18:03.600
He died.

18:04.280 --> 18:07.180
And instead, that Magus...

18:08.020 --> 18:09.010
Here.

18:13.920 --> 18:16.520
"The third will use the Holy Woman."

18:17.560 --> 18:19.560
Do you know the point of discharge?

18:19.560 --> 18:23.860
No, he was taken by a magic user.

18:24.260 --> 18:27.670
And that magic was interrupted halfway through.

18:28.700 --> 18:29.670
I see.

18:31.240 --> 18:32.470
What is Drei doing?

18:33.010 --> 18:35.110
He has not attempted to leave this mansion,

18:35.110 --> 18:36.870
and is waiting patiently,

18:37.780 --> 18:43.240
exchanging only a few words with Zwei, who is on watch.

18:46.450 --> 18:49.120
Drei is to remain under house arrest.

18:49.120 --> 18:50.260
Yes.

18:50.260 --> 18:54.060
Also, the retrieval of the Artifacts is on hold for the moment.

18:54.630 --> 18:56.060
I understand.

18:57.030 --> 18:59.730
I cannot feel at ease here.

19:02.000 --> 19:03.770
Did you say something?

19:04.770 --> 19:06.100
Just to myself.

19:19.190 --> 19:20.980
Can I help you with something?

19:21.520 --> 19:23.090
You're...

19:23.090 --> 19:26.490
Tamaki Kasuga's guardian.

19:26.490 --> 19:29.460
"Can I help you with something?" is quite the greeting.

19:29.460 --> 19:33.230
I believe this is a neutral zone far from government observation.

19:33.700 --> 19:35.070
So why?

19:35.070 --> 19:36.400
I see.

19:36.970 --> 19:40.970
I had heard there was a clever one among the guardians.

19:40.970 --> 19:42.140
I suppose that's you.

19:43.210 --> 19:46.480
I've forgotten to introduce myself.

19:46.480 --> 19:48.980
I'm Masataka Ashiya.

19:48.980 --> 19:51.140
I work as a public servant.

19:51.720 --> 19:54.280
I'm sorry. I've forgotten my card.

19:54.660 --> 19:56.320
I'll ask you again.

19:56.820 --> 20:00.130
What is your purpose in being here?

20:00.130 --> 20:02.650
Brr. You're cold.

20:03.160 --> 20:05.790
I've come to speak with the family predecessor.

20:06.930 --> 20:10.130
I'm aware that you're fighting with the Logos,

20:11.070 --> 20:14.170
and that you're in a very unfavorable situation.

20:15.840 --> 20:20.300
Simply put, I've come to help you out.

20:25.350 --> 20:28.190
Kiyono's uncle?

20:31.020 --> 20:32.860
Do you think I can trust you?

20:33.490 --> 20:36.100
Someone intervening at a time like this...

20:36.100 --> 20:38.930
must have an ulterior motive, no matter how you think of it.

20:38.930 --> 20:42.400
An ulterior motive?
This is a world crisis.

20:42.400 --> 20:45.270
Of course we need to save it.

20:45.270 --> 20:46.830
Right, Tamaki?

20:52.880 --> 20:55.880
Um, I don't really understand...

20:55.880 --> 20:57.920
Tamaki, who is this guy?

20:57.920 --> 20:59.320
Do you know him?

20:59.320 --> 21:01.410
Ohmi. I'll take care of him.

21:01.520 --> 21:02.420
Wai-

21:01.820 --> 21:03.190
Enough.

21:04.760 --> 21:06.420
Grandma?

21:07.230 --> 21:09.360
You said your name was Ashiya?

21:11.400 --> 21:15.700
I'll tell the other two guardians to return right away.

21:18.540 --> 21:20.270
What's wrong?

21:23.780 --> 21:26.410
You've come to talk, have you not?

21:26.910 --> 21:29.380
Yes. I have.

23:09.320 --> 23:11.250
Bureau of Medicine?

23:11.250 --> 23:13.990
Precisely. The Bureau of Medicine...

23:13.990 --> 23:16.320
is a branch of government overseeing the imperial court.

23:17.560 --> 23:22.230
To be brief, your objectives and ours are the same.

23:22.230 --> 23:23.820
The preservation of the seal.

23:24.870 --> 23:30.860
Hence, we would like to cooperate with you.

23:37.480 --> 23:39.580
What are you doing?

23:39.580 --> 23:42.410
Hey, hold on properly.

23:43.420 --> 23:47.250
You really are clumsy.

23:50.160 --> 23:53.150
I won't let go again.

23:55.600 --> 24:01.030
Next Time: The Prediction of
The Bureau of Medicine
